# Input

```svelte
<span>
	Showing the first {shown} of {total} references
</span>

<span>
	Showing the first {shown} of
	{total} references
</span>

<span>{total} references
	foo</span>

<div>
	Showing the first {shown} of
	{total} references
</div>

<p>
	Showing the first <b>shown</b> of
	<b>total</b> references
</p>

<span>
	Showing the first {shown} of
	{total} references_that_do_not_fit_on_the_line
</span>

```


